    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d828">

                <pb facs="0857" n="755" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.3311/177a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Japan (Grew)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-03T18:00:00-04:00">May 3, 1933—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>45. The visit of the Japanese training squadron on the West Coast has been
                    satisfactorily completed, Navy Department and this <pb facs="0858" n="756"
                        xml:id="pg756"/> Department are now considering advisability of a visit to
                    Japan by Commander-in-Chief Asiatic Fleet on flagship. Navy is ascertaining
                    Admiral’s present views. Department requests your views.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
